{"id":"n56641-1-7","stage":2,"title":"미지근하다 · 温乎乎","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56641-1-7-1","ko":"날씨가 추워서 국이 빨리 식네.","zh":"天气这么冷，汤很快就凉了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추워서","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"국이","meaning":"汤","explanation":"국：汤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"국","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36778","senseId":"1","lemma":"국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식네.","meaning":"凉","explanation":"식다：凉；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"식다","audio":"/audio/6ae572e959621a79ba3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30204","senseId":"1","lemma":"식다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"8178f6b3db96ee30","term":"국","zh":"汤","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3","entryId":"36778","definition":"在肉类、鱼类或蔬菜等上倒入大量的水而煮成的食物。","pronunciation":["국"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"6ae572e959621a79","term":"식다","zh":"凉","audio":"/audio/6ae572e959621a79ba3c.mp3","entryId":"30204","definition":"热气消退。","pronunciation":["식따"]}],"audio":"/audio/990eda0cd173e65bf72a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56641-1-7-2","ko":"미지근하면 다시 데울까요?","zh":"如果温度不够的话，要再热一下吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미지근하면","meaning":"温乎乎，温热","explanation":"미지근하다：温乎乎，温热；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"미지근하다","audio":"/audio/103b77bb6a9b021ffd89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56641","senseId":"1","lemma":"미지근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再，再次","explanation":"다시：再，再次","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"1","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데울까요?","meaning":"热，温，暖","explanation":"데우다：热，温，暖；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"데우다","audio":"/audio/80b498ba41d9194c8dcd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14380","senseId":"1","lemma":"데우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"103b77bb6a9b021f","term":"미지근하다","zh":"温乎乎，温热","audio":"/audio/103b77bb6a9b021ffd89.mp3","entryId":"56641","definition":"不冷不热，略有热气。","pronunciation":["미지근하다"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再，再次","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"反复相同的话或行动。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"80b498ba41d9194c","term":"데우다","zh":"热，温，暖","audio":"/audio/80b498ba41d9194c8dcd.mp3","entryId":"14380","definition":"使冷的东西变温热。","pronunciation":["데우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d6017eed0df4f0c39be0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.105,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56641","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":